    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_19970410.0247\n\nBEIJING, April 10 , 1997 (AFP)\n\n500,000 Dutch tulips deck out Beijing park\n\n\n\n\nMore than 500,000 Dutch tulips will deck out a park next to Beijing's Tiananmen Square from April 12, China's official Xinhua news agency reported Thursday.\n\nThe tulips, provided by the Dutch Euro-Asia Flower Group, will be arranged in ten large floral mozaics in Zhongshan park and are aimed at giving Beijingers a taste of the Netherlands in Spring.\n\nThe one-month display will also feature 6,000 blooming peonies, azaleas, and orchids.",
